  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demonstration of sustainable nanobubble technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to demonstrate the effectiveness of the nanobubble irrigation technology of Aquamar for high-value crops in Peru. Widespread adoption of this technology will allow farmers in Peru to scale up their operations in semi-arid and arid environments. This will improve the export position of Peruvian farmers and engender rural economic development.</narrative>
  </description>
